WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.568 --> 00:00:02.801
-Here's how it works.
We have nine mystery boxes

00:00:02.801 --> 00:00:05.037
containing objects
no one has ever seen before.

00:00:05.037 --> 00:00:07.340
On your turn, you pick a box,
take out the object,

00:00:07.340 --> 00:00:08.741
describe it to your opponent.

00:00:08.741 --> 00:00:10.876
They have to guess if you're
lying or telling the truth.

00:00:10.876 --> 00:00:12.378
We'll play three rounds.

00:00:12.378 --> 00:00:17.517
Blake, why don't you
pick the first...box?

00:00:17.517 --> 00:00:19.151
-I feel like I'm on
"The Price is Right."

00:00:19.151 --> 00:00:20.753
That was so exciting.

00:00:20.753 --> 00:00:22.321
Okay, I take it first?

00:00:22.321 --> 00:00:25.357
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:25.357 --> 00:00:28.461
-Alright. Already,
it looks pretty light.

00:00:28.461 --> 00:00:30.095
Could have pretended
it was heavy,

00:00:30.095 --> 00:00:32.064
but you didn't. Yeah.

00:00:32.064 --> 00:00:34.233
Well, alright.

00:00:34.233 --> 00:00:36.669
♪♪

00:00:36.669 --> 00:00:38.571
-Oh, Lord, have mercy.

00:00:38.571 --> 00:00:40.573
[ Laughter ]

00:00:40.573 --> 00:00:42.608
Okay.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:42.608 --> 00:00:44.844
What I have in my hands here --

00:00:44.844 --> 00:00:46.913
-Yeah. What do you have
in your hands there?

00:00:46.913 --> 00:00:50.283
-It's milky.

00:00:50.283 --> 00:00:54.854
There's some soggy,
rainbow-y chunks in here.

00:00:54.854 --> 00:00:58.358
It's a milky, soggy,
rainbow-y, chunky --

00:00:58.358 --> 00:01:00.760
-This is how
you describe something?

00:01:00.760 --> 00:01:02.595
This is how you describe
something real

00:01:02.595 --> 00:01:04.397
