-Time-telling device.

00:01:04.397 --> 00:01:07.533
-Oh? Time-telling device?
-Mm-hmm.

00:01:07.533 --> 00:01:10.370
-Now, that would only mean one
thing to me, a watch, perhaps?

00:01:10.370 --> 00:01:11.770
-Mm-hmm.
-What else could tell time,

00:01:11.770 --> 00:01:13.605
a sundial?

00:01:13.605 --> 00:01:16.342
-Mm-hmm, yeah, a sundial.

00:01:16.342 --> 00:01:18.210
What are you, like,
an ancient Greek?

00:01:18.210 --> 00:01:21.313
-Yeah, well, a time-telling
device? Who says that?

00:01:21.313 --> 00:01:22.581
I think that you're lying.

00:01:22.581 --> 00:01:25.084
I do not believe
that that is what you have.

00:01:25.084 --> 00:01:27.286
You are -- That is a lie.

00:01:27.286 --> 00:01:29.656
-Do I win if you got it right,
or do I win if --

00:01:29.656 --> 00:01:31.624
[ Laughter ]

00:01:31.624 --> 00:01:33.893
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:38.932 --> 00:01:41.701
-To be honest -- To be honest,
I just forgot for a second.

00:01:41.701 --> 00:01:43.002
[ Laughter ]

00:01:43.002 --> 00:01:45.771
You -- No, if I get it right,
you lose.

00:01:45.771 --> 00:01:47.173
-Then I was lying?
-Yes.

00:01:47.173 --> 00:01:48.774
-Oh, I want to take it back.

00:01:48.774 --> 00:01:50.976
-No!

00:01:50.976 --> 00:01:53.780
-Wait.
-Wait, what?

00:01:53.780 --> 00:01:56.715
Oh, wait.

00:01:56.715 --> 00:01:58.984
You did win.
Oh, my gosh. You won.

00:01:58.984 --> 00:02:00.252
That was --
[ Dinging ]

00:02:00.252 --> 00:02:03.255
Oh. No, I saw
what you did there.

00:02:03.255 --> 00:02:06.426
That was a very odd description,
a very odd description.

00:02:06.426 --> 00:02:07.760
-The weirdest game
I've ever played.

00:02:07.760 --> 00:02:09.662
-She did have that.
You're right. It's an odd game.

00:02:09.662 --> 00:02:12.298
-Who makes these things up?
-Dude, we --

00:02:12.298 --> 00:02:13.332
Alright. Alright.

00:02:13.332 --> 00:02:15.101
[ Audience shouting
indistinctly ]

00:02:15.101 --> 00:02:17.503
