00:02:18.972 --> 00:02:21.774
Here we go. Here we go. Alright.

00:02:21.774 --> 00:02:22.808
-Oh, God.

00:02:22.808 --> 00:02:25.111
-Oh, my goodness.

00:02:25.111 --> 00:02:26.579
